!.codex/agents/mycelium-*.toml

# Understand-Anything — commit the graph data (knowledge-graph.json, meta.json,
# fingerprints.json, .understandignore) so the dashboard CI can publish it;
# ignore scratch, local config, and any local static build. This is development
# visualization infrastructure, not part of the published Mycelium product.
.understand-anything/intermediate/
.understand-anything/tmp/
.understand-anything/.trash-*/
.understand-anything/dashboard-static/
.understand-anything/config.json

